 it that resets. Nothing ever leaves the pool; it just stops nagging you. RICOCHET, BUFFEDRICOCHET shots now hit +1 harder on every shot, and each wall bounce adds another +1. Bank a PINBALL shot off two walls and","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-06T15:29:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814451019","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:41:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5085140-1842846814441161","game_id":"steam-5085140","kind":"update","title":"Demo Update","summary":"Demo Update is live! Thanks to everyone who played the demo and sent feedback. This update is built almost entirely from your reports. New Your score is now visible during play, top right next to your cores A proper crosshair replaces the system cursor during combat, so you never lose track of your aim Photosensitivity warning on first boot, answerable with mouse, keyboard, or controller. Flash Reduction now also softens the full screen flashes on round transitions and death into a gentle edge p","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-02T17:46:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814441161","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:41:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5085140":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:01:37Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:01:36Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5085140":"2026-10-26T08:01:37Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5085140":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:01:36Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:01:36Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T08:01:36Z"},"5085210":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T08:01:37Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T08:01:37Z","status":"ok","erro